      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit short. it needs more specific details on the \"truth\" part. like, can you add a section that goes into the actual facts of how they're killing the planet and why their arguments about \"jobs\" or \"energy independence\" are just lies they tell to keep making money? make it sound like those justifications are totally fraudulent.",
